{"id":"R17","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":3,"why":"Ancaman blokir akun dipakai agar kita panik dan menuruti perintah.","any_of":["akun[^.\\n]{0,15}(diblokir|dibekukan|ditutup|dinonaktifkan)","diblokir permanen","(?:akun|kartu|rekening|nomor|layanan|kepesertaan)[^.\\n]{0,25}(?:akan )?(?:diblokir|dibekukan|ditutup|dinonaktifkan|dicabut)"]},
{"id":"R18","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":3,"why":"Ancaman hukum lewat chat adalah cara menekan korban.","any_of":["dilaporkan ke (polisi|pihak berwajib)","somasi","tindak pidana"]},
