{"id":"E26","tactic":"ISOLASI","weight":2,"why":"Dipindah ke aplikasi lain untuk wawancara atau tugas bisa jadi cara menghindari pengawasan platform.","any_of":["\\btelegram\\b","\\bwhatsapp\\b","\\bsignal\\b","\\bwechat\\b","\\bcontact me on\\b"],"also_requires":["\\binterview\\b","\\btask\\b","\\bjob\\b","\\boffer\\b","\\bopportunity\\b","\\brecruit","\\brole\\b","\\bposition\\b","\\bwork\\b"]},
{"id":"E27","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Pesan dari 'keluarga atau teman' dengan nomor baru perlu dikonfirmasi lewat telepon atau kanal yang sudah dikenal.","any_of":["\\b(?:this is|it'?s) my new (?:phone )?number\\b","\\b(?:hi|hello|hey) (?:mom|mum|dad|mama|papa)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\bnew (?:phone )?number\\b","\\bmy (?:old )?phone (?:is )?(?:broken|broke|was stolen|got stolen|died)\\b","\\bsave this (?:new )?number\\b","\\blost my phone\\b","\\busing a friend'?s (?:phone|number)\\b"]},
{"id":"E28","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Permintaan uang mendesak dari orang yang dikenal lewat pesan harus dicek lewat telepon atau kanal lain.","any_of":["\\b(?:need|send|transfer|wire)\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:money|cash|\\$\\d[\\d,]*|\\d[\\d,]* (?:dollars|usd|euros?))\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:urgent(?:ly)?|emergency|asap|right now|today)\\b","\\b(?:stranded|stuck (?:in|at|abroad|overseas))\\b[^.\\n]{0,70}\\b(?:send|wire|transfer)\\b","\\bin (?:an )?emergency\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:send|wire|transfer)\\b","\\b(?:can|could|would) you (?:please )?(?:send|lend|transfer|wire)(?: me)?\\s+\\$?\\d","\\b(?:venmo|cash ?app|zelle)\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:send|pay|transfer)\\b","\\bhelp (?:me )?pay(?:ing)?\\b[^.\\n]{0,30}\\b(?:leave|visa|ticket|papers|customs|clearance|bail)\\b"]},
{"id":"E29","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Kedekatan yang dibangun cepat dan berujung permintaan uang adalah pola khas love scam.","any_of":["\\bi(?:'ve| have) never felt (?:this|like this|this way)\\b","\\byou are (?:the one|my soul ?mate)\\b","\\b(?:stationed|deployed|working) (?:abroad|overseas|offshore)\\b","\\bmy (?:love|darling|dear)\\b[^.\\n]{0,70}\\b(?:send|wire|transfer|help me)\\b","\\b(?:soldier|military|army|navy|peacekeep\\w*)\\b[^.\\n]{0,60}\\b(?:overseas|abroad|deployed|serving)\\b","\\bget to know you\\b"]},
{"id":"E30","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Janji untung kripto atau trading yang pasti dan airdrop yang meminta dompet sering dipakai penipu.","any_of":["\\b(?:crypto|bitcoin|usdt|forex|trading)\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:guaranteed|insider|signals?|double|\\d+% (?:daily|weekly|monthly))\\b","\\bairdrop\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:wallet|claim|connect)\\b","\\bconnect your wallet\\b"]},
{"id":"E31","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":4,"why":"Diminta memasang aplikasi akses jarak jauh membuat pihak lain bisa mengendalikan perangkatmu dan rekeningmu.","any_of":["\\b(?:anydesk|teamviewer|ultraviewer|quick ?support|remote access)\\b[^.\\n]{0,60}\\b(?:install|download|support|fix|refund|bank)\\b","\\b(?:install|download)\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:anydesk|teamviewer|ultraviewer)\\b"]},
{"id":"E32","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Kabar uang kembali atau kelebihan bayar yang meminta kita klik atau mengirim data rekening sering menjadi jebakan.","any_of":["\\b(?:refund|reimburse\\w*)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:click|link|verify|confirm|account details|bank details)\\b","\\boverpa(?:id|yment)\\b","\\b(?:refund|reimburse\\w*)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:provide|bank login|login)\\b"]},
{"id":"E33","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":3,"why":"Diminta memverifikasi atau memulihkan akun lewat tautan adalah pola phishing yang sangat umum.","any_of":["\\b(?:verify|confirm|update|restore|unlock|reactivate|secure|validate)\\b[^.\\n]{0,20}\\b(?:your )?(?:account|identity|payment|billing|details|information|wallet)\\b[^.\\n]{0,60}(?:https?://|\\bclick\\b|\\blink\\b|\\bbelow\\b)","\\b(?:verify|confirm|update|restore|unlock|reactivate|secure|validate)\\b[^.\\n]{0,15}\\baccess\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}(?:https?://|\\bclick\\b|\\blink\\b|\\bbelow\\b)"]},
{"id":"E34","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":4,"why":"Diminta menyebutkan atau meneruskan kode yang baru dikirim ke ponselmu hampir pasti upaya mengambil alih akun.","any_of":["(?:send|share|give|provide|tell|read out)\\w*\\s+(?:me\\s+|us\\s+)?your\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}code\\b","\\b(?:read|tell|give|share|send)\\b[^.\\n]{0,15}\\bthe code\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:we|i) (?:just )?(?:texted|sent|messaged|emailed)\\b"],"unless":["(?:do not|don'?t|never|won'?t|will not|would not|should not|shouldn'?t|cannot|can'?t)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,5}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"E35","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":2,"why":"Diminta membalas dengan data pribadi lengkap untuk menerima hadiah atau peluang adalah cara mengumpulkan data korban.","any_of":["\\breply with your (?:full name|address|phone|details|email|bank)\\b","\\bsend (?:me )?your (?:full name|home address|phone number)\\b"]},
{"id":"J01","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":4,"why":"Istilah khas judi online seperti gacor, maxwin, atau scatter. Pesan seperti ini hampir selalu mengajak berjudi, yang ilegal di Indonesia dan sering dipakai untuk menjebak korban agar terus menyetor.","any_of":["\\b(?:gacor|gacir|maxwin|max win|jackpot|jekpot|jakpot|mahjong ways|sca?t+er|ska?t+er|togel|judol|judi (?:online|bola|slot|poker)|sbobet|cas[il]no|kas[il]no|baccarat|sicbo|taruhan|freebet|free bet|free ?spin|spin gratis)\\b"],"squeeze":["gh?acor","maxwin","ja?c?kpot","jekpot","sca?t+er","mahjong","togel","judol","slotgacor","situsslot","agenslot"]},
{"id":"J01b","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Kata 'slot' bersama kata lain khas judi (menang, bonus, depo, jepe, wede). Ini pola iklan situs judi online.","any_of":["\\bslot\\b"],"also_requires":["menang|win|bonus|depo|jp|jepe|wede|gacor|bet|maxwin|zeus|scatter|modal|saldo|akun baru"]},
{"id":"J02","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":4,"why":"Istilah 'jepe' (jackpot) atau 'wede' (withdraw/tarik dana) adalah bahasa gaul judi online.","any_of":["\\b(?:wede+|jepe+h?|jipi)\\b"]},
{"id":"J03","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Singkatan JP (jackpot) atau WD (withdraw) yang muncul bersama ajakan bermain atau mendaftar adalah bahasa gaul judi online.","any_of":["\\b(?:wd|w[ ,.]{1,3}d|jp|j[ ,.]{1,3}p)\\b"],"also_requires":["situs|link|akun|member|depo|deposit|slot|gacor|main|menang|bonus|saldo|modal|pasti|garansi|dijamin|cepat dan aman|bossku|\\bkak\\b|\\bkka\\b|https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
{"id":"J05","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":4,"why":"Janji kemenangan pasti ('garansi kemenangan', 'wajib dikasih menang') tidak mungkin ditepati. Permainan judi dirancang agar bandar yang untung.","any_of":["(?:garans[il]|d[il]jam[il]n|jam[il]n|wajib)[^.\\n]{0,30}\\b(?:menang|kemenangan|cuan|untung)"],"squeeze":["(?:garans[il]|d[il]jam[il]n|wajib)(?:kemenangan|menang|cuan)"]},
{"id":"J06","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Kalimat pancingan 'jarang wede' atau 'sering kalah' dipakai situs judi untuk menarik korban yang ingin balik modal.","any_of":["\\b(?:jarang|susah|sulit|sering|belum pernah|ga pernah|gak pernah|nggak pernah)\\s+(?:w ?d|wede+|jp|j p|jepe+|menang|cuan|maxwin)\\b","\\b(?:kalah terus|boncos)\\b"]},
{"id":"J07","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Modal receh dan 'sekali depo' dipakai untuk membuat judi terasa murah dan aman dicoba. Di situlah jebakannya: setoran akan terus naik.","any_of":["\\bmo?da?[il]\\b[^.\\n]{0,15}\\b(?:receh|recehan|minimal|kecil|murah|\\d+ ?(?:k|rb|ribu))\\b","\\b(?:depo|deposit|dp|top ?up)\\b[^.\\n]{0,15}\\b(?:receh|minimal|\\d+ ?(?:k|rb|ribu))\\b","\\b(?:1 ?x|sekali|satu kali|1 kali)\\s+(?:depo|deposit|dp|top ?up)\\b"]},
{"id":"J08","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":4,"why":"Pemberian 'saldo gratis' untuk bermain adalah umpan agar kamu mendaftar dan akhirnya menyetor uang sendiri.","any_of":["\\b(?:ada|dapat|dpt|dapet|dapatkan|ksh|kasih|kasi|bagi|bagikan|beri|dikasih|dibagi|klaim|claim)\\w*\\s+(?:km |kamu |anda |kalian )?(?:saldo|sld|modal|chip|bonus|dana|free)\\b[^.\\n]{0,12}\\b(?:gratis )?\\d+ ?(?:k|rb|ribu|jt|juta)\\b","\\b(?:saldo|sld)\\b[^.\\n]{0,8}\\d+ ?(?:k|rb|ribu)\\b[^.\\n]{0,20}\\b(?:main|mn|bermain|slot|jp|menang)\\b","\\b(?:id|akun|member) baru\\b[^.\\n]{0,15}\\b(?:wajib|pasti|dijamin)\\b"]},
{"id":"J09","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Frasa seperti 'chip auto masuk', 'banjir scatter', atau pengali x500 adalah bahasa promosi situs judi slot.","any_of":["\\b(?:chip|saldo|bonus|kredit)\\s+(?:auto|otomatis|langsung)\\s+(?:m(?:a)?suk|cair|ditambah|nambah)","\\bauto\\s+(?:m(?:a)?suk|cair|jp|wd|menang)\\b","\\bbanjir\\s+(?:sca?t+er|jp|jepe|maxwin|cuan)","\\bpecahan (?:beruntun|sca?t+er)\\b","\\bx ?(?:100|250|500|1000|5000|10000)\\b"]},
