{"id":"J11","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":2,"why":"Ajakan 'daftar dan main' atau 'join sekarang' dengan nada heboh khas pesan promosi massal.","any_of":["\\bnikmati\\W+(?:ke)?seru","\\bjoin\\s+(?:langsung|sekarang)","\\bburuan\\s+(?:join|daftar|dftr|gabung)","\\bd(?:a)?ftr\\b","\\bdp ?(?:&|dan) ?klaim","\\b(?:rasakan|nikmati)\\s+sensasi","\\bsitus\\s+(?:terbesar|terpercaya|resmi|terbaik)\\b[^.\\n]{0,12}\\b(?:indo|indonesia)\\b","\\b(?:gas|ayo|yuk|siap)[^.\\n]{0,15}\\b(?:dftr|daftar|join|gabung|main|mn)\\b"],"squeeze":["langsung(?:k[il]k|[il]ink)","join[il]?langsung"]},
