{"id":"J13","tactic":"TAUTAN MENCURIGAKAN","weight":3,"why":"Nama domain memuat istilah atau angka khas situs judi online (misalnya gacor, maxwin, atau 777).","any_of":["\\b[a-z0-9-]*(?:slot|gacor|maxwin|togel|judi|casino|jepe|wede|wde|scatter|[a-z](?:77|88|138|168|188|303|777|888|999|4d))[a-z0-9-]*\\.(?:org|com|net|xyz|top|click|icu|site|online|vip|cc|club|win|bet|live|fun|asia|id|co|me|pro|info|biz|link|store|shop|app|la|st|ly|run)\\b"]},
{"id":"N01","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":4,"why":"Pesan mengaku ada dana atau deposit yang 'sudah masuk' sambil menyertakan tautan. Ini umpan agar kamu membuka tautan dan akhirnya menyetor uang atau memberi data. Cek saldo lewat aplikasi resmi, bukan tautan.","any_of":["(?:deposit|saldo|dana|uang|hadiah|bonus|dompet)[^\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh)\\s+(?:di)?(?:kredit|transfer|kirim|tambah|masuk)","\\b(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh)\\s+(?:di)?(?:kredit|transfer|kirim)\\w*\\s+ke\\s+(?:akun|rekening|dompet|wallet|saldo)","(?:rp\\.? ?\\d[\\d.,]*|\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)? ?(?:juta|jt|ribu|rb|k))\\s+(?:anda\\s+|kamu\\s+)?(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh|baru)\\s+(?:di)?(?:transfer|kirim|kredit|cair|masuk|tambah)\\w*"],"also_requires":["https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
{"id":"N02","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":3,"why":"Batas waktu verifikasi yang sangat singkat dipakai agar kamu tidak sempat berpikir.","any_of":["\\bverifikasi\\b[^.\\n]{0,10}\\b(?:maks\\w*|max\\w*|dalam|paling lama|batas)\\s*\\d+\\s*(?:jam|menit|hari)"]},
